		// SolynExtension2: ...What's that face supposed to mean?
	}

	Census.SpawnCondition: 击败过任意Boss。
	CycleShop: 切换商店
	PreHM: 困难模式前
	HM: 困难模式
	PostML: 月亮领主后
}

